    "name": "AstroVoids",
    "steam_appid": 3603510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AstroVoids is a fast-paced space roguelike where you'll face relentless hordes of enemies trying to destroy you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, choose a new upgrade and discover how powerful your build can become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your ship indestructible and dominate the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your best build and find out how far you can go in the vacuum of space!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/790c8ccd342ccf6b8244123f29672277.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AstroVoids is a fast-paced space roguelike where you'll face relentless hordes of enemies trying to destroy you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/e92eb84c8fc25016f51d090677c53146.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, choose a new upgrade and discover how powerful your build can become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.poster.avif?t=1751508288\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.webm?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/24947c2ec215d0055527552d27849132.mp4?t=1751508288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your ship indestructible and dominate the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your best build and find out how far you can go in the vacuum of space!</p>",
    "short_description": "Blast through space enemies, master insane upgrades, and face cosmic horrors! AstroVoids is a frantic action roguelike where every choice shapes your build. Upgrade your ship, survive waves of chaos, and fight for the top of the leaderboard!",
